l Release","review_status":"","venue":"","title":"科学のためのAI戦略","title_original":"AI for Science Strategy","summary":"英国の戦略は、AIを活用した科学のために15の行動を設定し、研究プロジェクトにGPU時間を提供する。","url":"https://www.gov.uk/government/publications/ai-for-science-strategy/ai-for-science-strategy"},{"id":"eec3dc3f0d8c3cb324a1d96a","published_at":"2025-10-22T08:39:00Z","region":"EU & Europe","country":"European Union","topics":[],"article_frames":["Innovation Policy"],"policy_areas":["R&D Funding & Tax Incentives"],"policy_relevance":4,"source_type":"Government","source":"European Commission Research & Innovation","organization":"European Commission Research & Innovation","academic_kind":"News & Official Release","review_status":"","venue":"","title":"EU、955億ユーロ規模の研究・イノベーション助成制度で公募","title_original":"Funding programmes and open calls","summary":"EUの研究・イノベーション計画「Horizon Europe」は、2021～2027年に955億ユーロを投じ、研究協力、知識・技術の創出と普及、産業競争力の強化を支援する。","url":"https://research-and-innovation.ec.europa.eu/funding/funding-opportunities/funding-programmes-and-open-calls_en"},{"id":"bfa48b5832fad87c62f1f1b0","published_at":"2025-10-06T13:22:00Z","region":"EU & Europe","country":"European Patent Organisation","topics":[],"article_frames":["Innovation Policy"],"policy_areas":["Patents & Intellectual Property","R&D Funding & Tax Incentives"],"policy_relevance":4,"source_type":"Intergovernmental","source":"European Patent Office News","organization":"European Patent Office News","academic_kind":"News & Official Release","review_status":"","venue":"","title":"欧州特許庁、イノベーターの金融市場アクセスを支援するプログラムを展開","title_original":"Financing innovation programme","summary":"欧州特許庁は、発明者やスタートアップ、中小企業による金融市場へのアクセス改善を目的とするイノベーション・プログラムを紹介した。特許出願企業や投資家、大学発スピンアウトを探せる情報基盤も提供する。","url":"https://epo.org/en/about-us/observatory-patents-and-technology/policy-and-funding/financing-innovation-programme"},{"id":"f5062cb90623083863eb5adc","published_at":"2025-09-15T00:00:00Z","region":"United States","country":"United States","topics":[],"article_frames":["Innovation Policy"],"policy_areas":["R&D Funding & Tax Incentives"],"policy_relevance":5,"source_type":"Government","source":"United States R&D Tax Policy Benchmarks","organization":"United States R&D Tax Policy Benchmarks","academic_kind":"News & Official Release","review_status":"","venue":"","title":"内部収入公報2025-38：研究または実験支出の取り扱い","title_original":"Internal Revenue Bulletin 2025-38: treatment of research or experimental expenditures under Sections 174 and 174A","summary":"IRSは新しい174A条を実施し、2024年12月31日以降の税年度に支払われた国内の研究または実験支出の即時控除を認めることを発表。","url":"https://www.irs.gov/irb/2025-38_IRB"},{"id":"3cc2aa25d59e24836c9fa4d8","published_at":"2025-08-27T08:17:00Z","region":"EU & Europe","country":"European Union","topics":["Healthcare"],"article_frames":["Innovation Policy"],"policy_areas":["R&D Funding & Tax Incentives"],"policy_relevance":4,"source_type":"Government","source":"European Commission Research & Innovation","organization":"European Commission Research & Innovation","academic_kind":"News & Official Release","review_status":"","venue":"","title":"EU、Horizon 2020で公衆衛生研究への助成を推進","title_original":"EU Research and Innovation on Public health","summary":"EUのHorizon 2020は、健康、環境、メンタルヘルス、医療システム、母子保健、グローバルヘルスなどの公衆衛生研究を助成対象としている。","url":"https://research-and-innovation.ec.europa.eu/research-area/health/public-health-research_en"},{"id":"234d256bd362cd224236af3c","published_at":"2025-08-27T00:00:00Z","region":"Asia","country":"China","topics":["Artificial Intelligence"],"article_frames":["Innovation Policy"],"policy_areas":["National Programs & Strategy","Public Procurement & Industrial Policy"],"policy_relevance":5,"source_type":"Government","source":"China Innovation Policy Benchmarks","organization":"China Innovation Policy Benchmarks","academic_kind":"News & Official Release","review_status":"","venue":"","title":"中国、AIプラス統合を加速する指針を発表","title_original":"China issues guideline to accelerate AI Plus integration","summary":"中国の国家指導部がAIの統合を加速するための指針を発表し、2030年までに90％の普及を目指す。","url":